   "like_count": 2,
   "cooked": "<p><img alt=\":partying_face:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/partying_face.png?v=10\" title=\":partying_face:\"/> <strong>Welcome to the Token Engineering Commons</strong> - we are so happy <strong>you</strong> are here! <img alt=\":sparkling_heart:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/sparkling_heart.png?v=10\" title=\":sparkling_heart:\"/></p>\n<p><img alt=\":ticket:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/ticket.png?v=10\" title=\":ticket:\"/> Here you can learn <strong>everything you need to know about our community</strong>:</p>\n<p><img alt=\":sparkles:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/sparkles.png?v=10\" title=\":sparkles:\"/> <strong><a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/what-is-the-tec/97/6\">What is the TEC?</a></strong> - Get to know our vision, values, mission &amp; work of the TEC<br/>\n<img alt=\":key:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/key.png?v=10\" title=\":key:\"/> <strong><a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/how-to-join-contribute/98/8\">How to Join &amp; Contribute</a></strong> - What to do &amp;  about our working groups<br/>\n<img alt=\":moneybag:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/moneybag.png?v=10\" title=\":moneybag:\"/> <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/how-to-get-hatch-tokens/113\"><strong>About TEC Tokens</strong></a> - The TEC rewards system &amp; how to get TEC &amp; CSTK<br/>\n<img alt=\":money_with_wings:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/money_with_wings.png?v=10\" title=\":money_with_wings:\"/> <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/submit-a-proposal-for-funding/102/4\"><strong>Submit a proposal for Funding</strong></a> - Get funds for your TE project<br/>\n<img alt=\":hatching_chick:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/hatching_chick.png?v=10\" title=\":hatching_chick:\"/> <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/tec-hatch-and-commons-upgrade/101/4\"><strong>TEC Hatch and Commons Upgrade</strong></a> - Check where we are at our journey towards a Commons.<br/>\n<img alt=\":books:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/books.png?v=10\" title=\":books:\"/> <a href=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/t/glossary-of-terms/114/4\"><strong>Glossary of Terms</strong></a> - Learn more about the terms used here</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://token-engineering-commons.gitbook.io/tec-source/\">We also have a library of resources that you can find here.</a></p>\n<p>We hope this small guide serves you well and we invite you to come and say hello on our <a href=\"https://discord.gg/trEBaY5\">Discord</a> or <a href=\"https://t.me/tecommons\">Telegram</a> channels.</p>\n<p>We also host <strong>Community Calls on Thursdays, 9am PST / 20 CET on our Discord General Voice channel</strong>. Add it to your <a href=\"https://www.notion.so/Calendar-be8a6868a6ef4305b7521fa35a2eb9ba\">calendar here</a>.</p>\n<p>See you around!</p>",
